{'symbol': 'PCG', 'date': '2022-03-03 12:40:00', 'title': 'PG&E TO HOST WEEKLY REGIONAL WILDFIRE SAFETY WEBINARS TO PROVIDE INFORMATION AND RESOURCES ON LOCAL WILDFIRE PREVENTION EFFORTS', 'text': "SAN FRANCISCO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PG&E IS HOSTING A SERIES OF WEEKLY REGIONAL WILDFIRE SAFETY WEBINARS TO SHARE ITS WILDFIRE PREVENTION PLANS IN 2022 AND LISTEN TO CUSTOMERS' FEEDBACK. EACH WEBINAR WILL FEATURE A BRIEF PRESENTATION, AFTER WHICH PARTICIPANTS WILL HAVE THE OPPORTUNITY TO ASK QUESTIONS AND PROVIDE FEEDBACK TO PG&E SUBJECT MATTER EXPERTS. WHILE THE WEBINAR EVENTS WILL FOCUS ON REGIONAL WORK IN THE LISTED COUNTIES, ALL PG&E CUSTOMERS ARE WELCOME TO JOIN. DURING THE WEBINAR"}